{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"2ca83081cad1c552","name":"card_event_special_reinforcements","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/WinterWar/events/card_event_special_reinforcements","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SPECIAL REINFORCEMENTS","text":"Add a copy of your last destroyed unit to your hand.","flavorText":"The Red Army Guards units were distinguished elite military formations within the Soviet Union, established during WWII to acknowledge and reward units that had demonstrated exceptional valor in combat. These units varied in quality depending on their specific composition and active period, but on the whole, they were regarded as highly effective and well-trained components of the Soviet armed forces. They were often entrusted with challenging and important missions on the battlefield and played a vital role in several of the Soviet Union's major victories in WWII, such as the Battle of Stalingrad and the Battle of Kursk. Comprising battle-hardened and seasoned soldiers, the Guards units received extensive training and support to ensure their effectiveness. They were also provided with access to the best available equipment and resources within the Soviet military at the time.","faction":"Soviet","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_special_reinforcements","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_special_reinforcements_title","SourceString":"SPECIAL REINFORCEMENTS","LocalizedString":"SPECIAL REINFORCEMENTS"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_special_reinforcements_text","SourceString":"Add a copy of your last destroyed unit to your hand.","LocalizedString":"Add a copy of your last destroyed unit to your hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_special_reinforcements_history","SourceString":"The Red Army Guards units were distinguished elite military formations within the Soviet Union, established during WWII to acknowledge and reward units that had demonstrated exceptional valor in combat. These units varied in quality depending on their specific composition and active period, but on the whole, they were regarded as highly effective and well-trained components of the Soviet armed forces. They were often entrusted with challenging and important missions on the battlefield and played a vital role in several of the Soviet Union's major victories in WWII, such as the Battle of Stalingrad and the Battle of Kursk. Comprising battle-hardened and seasoned soldiers, the Guards units received extensive training and support to ensure their effectiveness. They were also provided with access to the best available equipment and resources within the Soviet military at the time.","LocalizedString":"The Red Army Guards units were distinguished elite military formations within the Soviet Union, established during WWII to acknowledge and reward units that had demonstrated exceptional valor in combat. These units varied in quality depending on their specific composition and active period, but on the whole, they were regarded as highly effective and well-trained components of the Soviet armed forces. They were often entrusted with challenging and important missions on the battlefield and played a vital role in several of the Soviet Union's major victories in WWII, such as the Battle of Stalingrad and the Battle of Kursk. Comprising battle-hardened and seasoned soldiers, the Guards units received extensive training and support to ensure their effectiveness. They were also provided with access to the best available equipment and resources within the Soviet military at the time."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WinterWar","isInPermanentPool":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDestroyed","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardCreatedAlterCa